{"SSRF vulnerability: TopicEmbed.import_remote fetches arbitrary URLs via open(url).read and Jobs::PollFeed fetches SiteSetting.feed_polling_url via open(...) without hardening. A malicious/compromised URL could target internal network resources or cause resource exhaustion.": 0.9688407778739929, "Clickjacking vulnerability: EmbedController sets X-Frame-Options to ALLOWALL and relies on request.referer host matching. Referer is not a reliable security boundary and can be absent/spoofed. Should use CSP frame-ancestors with explicit allowed origins and validate embedding origin robustly.": 0.9511628746986389, "XSS vulnerability: Embedded/imported content is persisted and rendered as raw HTML using cook_method raw_html and raw post.cooked. RSS/remote HTML can contain dangerous constructs like javascript: URLs, malformed attributes, data URIs, or unexpected tags. Server-side sanitization should be applied to contents before storing/rendering, and unsafe URL schemes in href/src should be validated/stripped.": 0.9906018972396851}